effects of particulate air pollution on cardiovascular diseases in eight European cities</article-title><source>J Epidemiol Community Health </source><year>2002</year><volume>56</volume><fpage>773</fpage><lpage>779</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12239204</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1136/jech.56.10.773</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Maheswaran</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Haining</surname><given-names>RP</given-names></name><name><surname>Brindley</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Law</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Pearson</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Fryers</surname><given-names>PR</given-names></name><name><surname>Wise</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Campbell</surname><given-names>MJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Outdoor air pollution, mortality, and hospital admissions from coronary heart disease in Sheffield, UK: a small-area level ecological study</article-title><source>Eur Heart J</source><year>2005</year><volume>26</volume><fpage>2543</fpage><lpage>2549</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16166102</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1093/eurheartj/ehi457</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>von Klot</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Peters</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Aalto</surname><given-names>PR</given-names></name><name><surname>H&#x000f6;rmann</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Kulmala</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Lanki</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>L&#x000f6;wel</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Pekkanen</surname><given-names>J</given-names